Z||000000||BAM-BAM||05-04-2001||08:59 PM||||  Well, when they installed my new KMC 782's, one got scratched and another was scratched from the factory. They ordered me two new wheels to replace those, and when they got here and after an hour and a half wait, I find out that KMC sent them two previously mounted wheels, one of which had terrible curb scuffs on it.  So now I have scrapped the KMC's and they are ordering me a set of KONIG Monsoons. The price of course will be adjusted . I guess it all turns out better in the long run, but it's just a pain. Thanks for the space and sorry to bother everyone.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Peace, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Knowledge is POWER!<BR>That is why the ignorant remain Weak!||||reg||9
